(text "Discrete OV disconnects are cost-oriented. Verify fault-step overshoot and thermal behavior.\nNo claim of true reverse-current blocking: use supply selection/isolation on attached boards.\nMotor bus current threshold ~3.04A plus tolerance; fuse is harness protection, not winding limit." (at 18 276 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid "50dbb9d9-2444-5f73-9bc8-53bdeae98e57"))
